      "question": "Statement: All laptops are devices. Some devices are pricey. All pricey things are taxed. Conclusions: I. Some devices are taxed. II. Some laptops are pricey?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Statement: All laptops are devices.&nbsp;Some devices are pricey.&nbsp;All pricey things are taxed.<br />\n<br />\nConclusions: I. Some devices are taxed. II. Some laptops are pricey?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I follows",
          "html": "Only I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II follows",
          "html": "Only II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both follow",
          "html": "Both follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither follows",
          "html": "Neither follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/01/Task%20Id%202039%20Daman%20%288%29.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 122px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Conclusions:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Some devices are taxed. → <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">F</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">ollow</span> (As some devices are pricey and all pricey things are taxed. As some part of devices is common with pricey which whole comes in taxed, therefore it is true.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some laptops are pricey → <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Does not </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">f</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">ollow</span> (As all laptops are devices and some devices are pricey. So it is possible but not definite.)</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a0ad7df1-7fff-4d56-2075-2ace8f6b4ba1\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">∴ Here, </span></span>Only I follows.</p>\n",
