      "question": "If 6 workers take 6 hours to paint 6 walls, how long for 100 workers to paint 100 walls?",
      "questionHtml": "If 6 workers take 6 hours to paint 6 walls, how long for 100 workers to paint 100 walls?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "6 hours",
          "html": "6 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "100 hours",
          "html": "100 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "50 hours",
          "html": "50 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "10 hours",
          "html": "10 hours"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Rate of work per worker → 6 walls ÷ 6 workers = 1 wall per worker in 6 hours</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, 1 worker paints 1 wall in 6 hours</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, with 100 workers, each painting 1 wall each</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">∴ <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">100 worker paints 100 wall in 6 hours</span></p>\n",
